    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's so quiet when you think about it that way. just... letting go. but it's hard to actually do it. to face it alone in the middle of the night when the lanterns are dying out. what do you think is the most dignified way? to just fade away, or to make sure it's done right before they arrive?",
